      "detail_main_html": "<main class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"detail-head\">\n<h1>\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"40\" src=\"/static/icons/mindless-clutch-i.png\" style=\"vertical-align:-8px;margin-right:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\" width=\"40\"/>\n    \n    Mindless Clutch I\n  </h1>\n<p class=\"muted\">\n<a href=\"/classes/disciple\">Disciple</a>\n    \n    · Level 38\n    \n    \n  </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cols\">\n<div>\n<h2>Effect</h2>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">Forms a dissonant bond with an opponent, draining 40 energy every 4 seconds for 2 minutes. Only 1 Mindless Clutch allowed active at a time.</div>\n<h2>As it was earlier</h2>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n        What guides written while Vanguard was running recorded for this\n        ability. Kept beside the current figures rather than replacing them\n        — the game was rebalanced across its life, so both are right for\n        their own year.\n      </p>\n<dl class=\"facts\">\n<div><dt>Level in 2007-2008</dt>\n<dd>38</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Cast then</dt><dd>0</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Refresh then</dt><dd>2</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">Forms a dissonant bond with an opponent, draining 40 energy every 4 seconds for 2 minutes. Cost: Submit Info Jin Cost: 3 Cast Time: 0 Refresh: 2 Range: 25 Favor of the Crow III</div>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/2009id_/http://www.tentonhammer.com/node/59439\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Ten Ton Hammer class guides</a>,\n          \n          2007-2008 ·\n          <a href=\"/abilities/as-it-was\">every ability that changed</a>\n</p>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Previously recorded by The Telon Project as: “Forms a dissonant bond with an opponent, draining 40 energy every 4 seconds for 2 minutes” (http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/abilities:mindless-clutch-i)</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Read from the in-game tooltip in VGO Emulator. Bracketed damage figures shown in game are the skill- and level-adjusted values for that character and are not recorded here.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Details</h2>\n<dl class=\"kv\">\n<div><dt>Level</dt><dd>38</dd></div>\n<div><dt>energy and jin cost</dt><dd>25</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Jin cost</dt><dd>3</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Cast time</dt><dd>Instant</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Refresh</dt><dd>2.0s</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Range</dt><dd>25m</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Target</dt><dd>Offensive Target</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Dissonant Bond</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Learned from</dt><dd>Class Trainers</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul class=\"plain\">\n<li><strong>Verified from the in-game tooltip</strong>\n<span class=\"muted\">— these figures override the wikis</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://thetelonproject.wikidot.com/abilities:mindless-clutch-i\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">The Telon Project</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px\"><a href=\"/abilities\">← All abilities</a></p>\n</main>",
      "disposition": "Combined Energy and Jin Cost label does not specify how its number is allocated between resources. Separate Jin Cost 3 is explicit. Bare class cost agrees with the combined-label number, but does not establish an Energy-only interpretation. Preserve both observations without allocating or subtracting costs.",
